          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "Cere Collection"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "A study of form, material, and the relationships between objects and the spaces they inhabit."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "From seating and tables to cabinets, lighting, and smaller objects, each piece carries its own presence while remaining part of a larger composition."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Dark wood, patinated surfaces, stone, black lacquer, and considered details bring depth and contrast to the collection."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Cere was designed with the belief that a space is shaped not by a single statement, but by how each element comes together."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "A collection of individual pieces, thoughtfully considered as part of a whole."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h2",
              "text": ":"
            }
          ]
        },
